<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Sample: phone range features, Lotus-style</title><meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<style>
body{margin:0;padding:20px;background:#eceae6;font:14px/1.45 system-ui,sans-serif;color:#111}
h1{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 4px}p.n{margin:0 0 18px;color:#555;max-width:980px}
.row{display:flex;gap:28px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-start}
.ph{width:390px}.ph b{display:block;margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px}
.ph span{display:block;margin:8px 0 0;color:#444;font-size:13px;max-width:390px}
.ph iframe{display:block;width:390px;height:700px;border:8px solid #111;border-radius:34px;background:#fff}
</style></head><body>
<h1>Phone range features, Lotus-style (390 wide)</h1>
<p class="n">The four figures sit across the page with the label above and the value below, and the icons are gone. Each frame is the real homepage, scrolled to the viewer on the Solara. Swipe the van to check the other models: the widest value is &ldquo;12&rdquo; DRUM&rdquo;, the widest label is SUSPENSION.</p>
<div class="row">
<div class="ph"><b>Now</b><iframe data-v="now" title="Now"></iframe><span>Icons, label left, value right.</span></div>
<div class="ph"><b>A &middot; Lotus: one row of four</b><iframe data-v="a" title="A"></iframe><span>Label over value, four across, the small notes dropped. Closest to Lotus.</span></div>
<div class="ph"><b>B &middot; One row, notes kept</b><iframe data-v="b" title="B"></iframe><span>The same row, with the small note (VICTRON NEXUS, LITHIUM) wrapped under each value.</span></div>
<div class="ph"><b>C &middot; Two by two</b><iframe data-v="c" title="C"></iframe><span>Label over value in a 2&times;2 grid, notes kept. Roomier for the longer values.</span></div>
</div>
<script>
var BASE=".rvp-ico{display:none!important}.rvp-cellhead{display:block!important;grid-row:auto!important}";
var CSS={
 now:"",
 a:BASE+".rvp-spec{display:flex!important;justify-content:space-between;gap:6px;border-top:1px solid #e4e2de;border-bottom:1px solid #e4e2de;padding:18px 0}"+
   ".rvp-cell{display:block!important;flex:1 1 0;min-width:0;padding:0!important;border:0!important;text-align:center}"+
   ".rvp-k{font-size:9px!important;letter-spacing:.04em!important;font-weight:400!important}"+
   ".rvp-v{text-align:center!important;margin-top:10px!important;font-size:17px!important;line-height:22px!important;font-weight:400!important}"+
   ".rvp-n{display:none!important}",
 b:BASE+".rvp-spec{display:flex!important;justify-content:space-between;gap:6px;border-top:1px solid #e4e2de;border-bottom:1px solid #e4e2de;padding:18px 0}"+
   ".rvp-cell{display:block!important;flex:1 1 0;min-width:0;padding:0!important;border:0!important;text-align:center}"+
   ".rvp-k{font-size:9px!important;letter-spacing:.04em!important;font-weight:400!important}"+
   ".rvp-v{text-align:center!important;margin-top:10px!important;font-size:17px!important;line-height:22px!important;font-weight:400!important}"+
   ".rvp-n{text-align:center!important;font-size:9px!important;line-height:13px!important;margin-top:6px!important;letter-spacing:.02em!important}",
 c:BASE+".rvp-spec{display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border-top:1px solid #e4e2de}"+
   ".rvp-cell{display:block!important;padding:20px 0!important;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid #e4e2de!important}"+
   ".rvp-cell:nth-child(odd){border-right:1px solid #e4e2de}"+
   ".rvp-k{font-size:11px!important;letter-spacing:.06em!important;font-weight:400!important}"+
   ".rvp-v{text-align:center!important;margin-top:8px!important;font-size:24px!important;line-height:28px!important;font-weight:400!important}"+
   ".rvp-n{text-align:center!important;margin-top:4px!important}"
};
document.querySelectorAll("iframe[data-v]").forEach(function(f){
  f.addEventListener("load",function(){
    var d=f.contentDocument,w=f.contentWindow,s=d.createElement("style");s.textContent="@media (max-width:900px){"+CSS[f.dataset.v]+"}";d.head.appendChild(s);
    var n=0,t=setInterval(function(){
      var sec=d.querySelector(".rvp");if(sec)w.scrollTo(0,sec.getBoundingClientRect().top+w.scrollY-70);
      var dot=d.querySelectorAll("#rvpDots button")[2];if(dot&&!f._d){dot.click();f._d=1}
      if(++n>45)clearInterval(t)},400);
  });
  f.src="home.html?v=ph"+f.dataset.v;
});
</script></body></html>
